{"suttaId":"sn2.15","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-i","vriCode":"s0301m.mul","paras":[1058,1064],"vripara":"96"},"segments":{"sn2.15:0.3":"Candanasuttaṃ","sn2.15:1.1":"Ekamantaṃ ṭhito kho candano devaputto bhagavantaṃ gāthāya ajjhabhāsi –","sn2.15:2.1":"“Kathaṃsu [kosudha (sī.)] tarati oghaṃ, rattindivamatandito;","sn2.15:2.3":"Appatiṭṭhe anālambe, ko gambhīre na sīdatī”ti.","sn2.15:3.1":"“Sabbadā sīlasampanno, paññavā susamāhito;","sn2.15:3.3":"Āraddhavīriyo pahitatto, oghaṃ tarati duttaraṃ.","sn2.15:4.1":"“Virato kāmasaññāya, rūpasaṃyojanātigo;","sn2.15:4.3":"Nandīrāgaparikkhīṇo, so gambhīre na sīdatī”ti."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0301a.att","from":541,"to":541,"paras":[{"para":541,"vripara":"96","refs":["sn2.15:2","sn2.15:3","sn2.15:4"],"lines":["Pañcame <b>appatiṭṭhe anālambe</b>ti heṭṭhā apatiṭṭhe upari anālambane.","<b>Susamāhito</b>ti appanāyapi upacārenapi suṭṭhu samāhito.","<b>Pahitatto</b>ti pesitatto.","<b>Nandīrāgaparikkhīṇo</b>ti parikkhīṇanandīrāgo.","Nandīrāgo nāma tayo kammābhisaṅkhārā.","Iti imāya gāthāya kāmasaññāgahaṇena pañcorambhāgiyasaṃyojanāni, rūpasaṃyojanagahaṇena pañca uddhambhāgiyasaṃyojanāni, nandīrāgena tayo kammābhisaṅkhārā gahitā.","Evaṃ yassa dasa saṃyojanāni tayo ca kammābhisaṅkhārā pahīnā, so gambhīre mahoghe na sīdatīti.","Kāmasaññāya vā kāmabhavo, rūpasaṃyojanena rūpabhavo gahito, tesaṃ gahaṇena arūpabhavo gahitova, nandīrāgena tayo kammābhisaṅkhārā gahitāti evaṃ yassa tīsu bhavesu tayo saṅkhārā natthi, so gambhīre na sīdatītipi dasseti.","Pañcamaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn2.15:2"],["sn2.15:3"],["sn2.15:3"],["sn2.15:4"],["sn2.15:4"],["sn2.15:4"],["sn2.15:4"],["sn2.15:4"],["sn2.15:4"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn2.15:2.3","appatiṭṭhe anālambe",0,0],["sn2.15:3.1","susamāhito",0,1],["sn2.15:3.3","pahitatto",0,2],["sn2.15:4.3","nandīrāgaparikkhīṇo",0,3]],"before":[{"para":540,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["5-6. Candanasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0301t.tik","from":687,"to":689,"paras":[{"para":687,"vripara":"96","refs":["sn2.15:1"],"lines":["<b>Heṭṭhā</b>ti kāmabhave.","Tattha hi paribbhamantassa patiṭṭhā dullabhā yebhuyyena tattha sattā nimuggā eva honti, tasmā heṭṭhā appatiṭṭho saṃsāro.","<b>Uparī</b>ti mahaggatabhave.","Tattha hi nibbattassa nibbānaṃ āruhituṃ ālambanā dullabhā, jhānābhiratiyā tattheva nikanti tesaṃ balavatī hoti, tasmā upari anālambano saṃsāro.","<b>Pesitatto</b>ti nibbānaṃ pati pesitacitto.","<b>Tayo kammābhisaṅkhārā</b>ti puññābhisaṅkhārādayo tayo abhisaṅkhārā.","Tena “nandīpubbako kammabhavo”ti vatvā “nandiṃ janetvā”ti vutto.","Kāmasaññāsīsena kāmacchandassa gahaṇaṃ, kāmacchandapamukhāni ca orambhāgiyasaṃyojanāni gahitānīti āha <b>“kāmasaññāgahaṇena pañcorambhāgiyasaṃyojanānī”</b>ti.","Rūpabhavo rūpaṃ bhavapadalopena.","Rūpabhavaggahaṇena cettha sesabhavassapi gahaṇaṃ.","Tassa saṃyojanaggahaṇena pañca uddhambhāgiyasaṃyojanāni gahitāni.","<b>Mahoghe</b>ti saṃsāramahoghe.","<b>Tesan</b>ti kāmabhavādīnaṃ <b>gahaṇena</b> bhavabhāvena tadekalakkhaṇatāya.","<b>Arūpabhavo gahito</b> lakkhaṇahāranayena.","Sesaṃ suviññeyyameva."],"lineRefs":[["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"],["sn2.15:1"]]},{"para":688,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn2.15:1"],"lines":["Candanasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn2.15:1"]]},{"para":689,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn2.15:1"],"lines":["Vāsudattasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn2.15:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[],"before":[{"para":685,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Nandanasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":686,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Candanasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika2":null}
